Hey all,

I want to make sure everyone is clear on my plan for the release at 
current.  We've had our first testing branch done on the 10th and have 
gotten a number of good reports and a few bug reports back.  I plan to 
update the branch again on the 17th and depending on how we look update 
again possibly on the 21st or 22nd, and for certain on the 24th.

Where we stand on the 24th will dictate what happens next (with one 
possibility being that we tag that).  Once the release has happened I 
will leave it to others, if there is consensus and all of that, to work 
on branch based on the tag.  And by that same token I do not plan to 
make any "cherry pick" style branch prior to the 24th at the earliest.

Thanks all!

